# BORGHERTZS_CHASING_HANDS (jeuno 54): the two optional coffers' sections (status not available, main job RNG, the
# [AF]ZilartCoffer bit unset). Accepted by a GM, a level 75 RNG: CrawlersNest's Treasure Coffer opens to HuntersBraccae
# (the item bypass; the result is the item): [AF]ZilartCoffer +2097152 (bit 21); MonasticCavern's to HuntersJerkin:
# +4194304 (bit 22).
lists CrawlersNest/Treasure_Coffer/onTrade MonasticCavern/Treasure_Coffer/onTrade
char zone=CrawlersNest pos=58.9,0.4,69 job=RNG lvl=75
quest Jeuno.BorghertzsChasingHands accepted
item NestCofferKey
item DavoiCofferKey
login
tick 13000                              # the coffer placed
trigger Treasure_Coffer                 # walks to the coffer
trade Treasure_Coffer NestCofferKey x1  # bit 21 unset: HuntersBraccae; [AF]ZilartCoffer 2097152
tick 4500                               # the coffer opened
warp 107.5,-3,-144 MonasticCavern
tick 13000                              # the coffer placed
trigger Treasure_Coffer                 # walks to the coffer
trade Treasure_Coffer DavoiCofferKey x1 # bit 22 unset: HuntersJerkin; [AF]ZilartCoffer 6291456
tick 4500                               # the coffer opened
